          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "On a remote Adriatic island a group of children discovers a mysterious boy hidden in a nearby lighthouse. Convinced he’s an alien, imaginative Karlo from Zagreb rallies the gang on a mission to return him “home.” But when local boy Bumbar learns that the little one is actually an African refugee, the adventure turns into a struggle for justice and friendship.",
